Value function V(R) satisfies:

  max{ U(R) - V(R),  sup_u [ L^u V(R) - c(u) ] } = 0

where L^u is the generator:
  L^u V = f(R,u).grad V + (1/2)tr(sigma sigma^T Hess V)

