| sup FRV(u;R) > 0  |    | sup FRV(u;R) <= 0 |
|                   |    |                   |
| (reason further)  |    | (act now)         |
+-------------------+    +-------------------+
         |                       |
         +-----------++----------+
                     ||
              Free Boundary:
              grad V = grad U
              (smooth pasting)
